ox.co/shows/a1fbe83b-5625-4f4b-a117-4b130abdbf71.png","image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/b7a9c9a1-ec45-4628-a1dc-68fa91e82005.jpg","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/d3fd63eb-2267-4c9f-ba4e-046a00cc7f3a.jpg","likes":29,"dislikes":2,"views":4053,"release_date":"1726876800000","length":6262,"description":"Christopher Reeve portrayed the Man of Steel in four Superman films and played dozens of other roles that displayed his talent and range as an actor, before being injured in a near-fatal horse-riding accident in 1995 that left him paralyzed from the neck down. After becoming a quadriplegic, he became a charismatic leader and activist in the quest to find a cure for spinal cord injuries, as well as a passionate advocate for disability rights and care.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8}],"value":8,"age":"PG-14"},"episode_id":960455,"background_color":"#de0d0d","content_control":"FAMILY"}}